  "ruleSetPolicy": "",
  "description": "Businesses often offer time-sensitive discounts to encourage early payments. This rule ensures that customers get the best discount if they pay within a certain time frame.\n\nWithin 7 Days: 10% discount on the total amount.\nWithin 15 Days: 5% discount on the total amount.\nAfter 15 Days but before the due date: No discount is applied.\nAfter the Due Date: Late fee of 5% is charged.\nThis helps businesses improve cash flow while rewarding prompt payments.",
